    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, кто э́то, в чёрной ку́ртке?","gloss":"Masha, who's that in the black jacket?"},{"by":"b","text":"Э́то мой брат Ива́н.","gloss":"That's my brother Ivan."},{"by":"a","text":"Высо́кий и худо́й! А кто э́то, с бородо́й?","gloss":"Tall and thin! And who's that, with the beard?"},{"by":"b","text":"Э́то па́па. Ива́н о́чень похо́ж на па́пу.","gloss":"That's Dad. Ivan looks a lot like Dad."},{"by":"a","text":"А ты? Ты похо́жа на па́пу?","gloss":"And you? Do you look like Dad?"},{"by":"b","text":"Нет, я похо́жа на ма́му.","gloss":"No, I look like Mum."},{"by":"a","text":"У неё то́же голубы́е глаза́?","gloss":"Does she have blue eyes too?"},{"by":"b","text":"Да, и тёмные во́лосы, как у меня́.","gloss":"Yes, and dark hair, like me."}] practice true size 1.5 hidden true
    icon q_pair size 120 set twemoji x 400 y 480 or ["person beard","older man","man"] icon_look picture of "man beard" hidden true
    icon q_pair2 size 120 set twemoji x 600 y 480 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    icon q_ear size 240 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["headphone"] icon_look picture of ear hidden true
    ellipse q_eye_w thick #3d3833 x 500 y 500 rx 110 ry 52 hidden true
    shape q_eye_i #3d3833 shape circle x 500 y 500 radius 42 style.fill #7fb3e0 style.fill_style wash style.opacity 1 style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    shape q_eye_p #3d3833 shape circle x 500 y 500 radius 15 style.fill #3d3833 style.fill_style wash style.opacity 1 hidden true
    group q_eye members ["q_eye_w","q_eye_i","q_eye_p"] hidden true
    icon q_m2 size 120 set twemoji x 400 y 480 or ["woman","girl"] icon_look picture of "woman medium skin tone" hidden true
    icon q_d2 size 120 set twemoji x 600 y 480 or ["woman","girl"] icon_look picture of "woman medium skin tone" hidden true
    text q_full "Она́ высо́кая и похо́жа на ма́му." say "Она́ высо́кая и похо́жа на ма́му." colors {"ая$":"#b5482e","жа$":"#b5482e"} x 500 y 650 font_size 46 hidden true
    text b1 "Ива́н высо́кий, Оле́г ни́зкий." say "Ива́н высо́кий, Оле́г ни́зкий." x 500 y 600 font_size 50 hidden true
    text b2 "У неё голубы́е глаза́." say "У неё голубы́е глаза́." colors {"ые$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 480 font_size 50 hidden true
    text b3 "Он похо́ж на па́пу." say "Он похо́ж на па́пу." x 500 y 360 font_size 50 hidden true

A: You can already say what Masha is wearing: Ма́ша в зелёном пла́тье.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name dress known1

    erase known1 dress

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Today, the person: how tall, eyes and hair, and who they look like.
    draw floor ivan ivan_n oleg oleg_n

B: Ivan is tall: Ива́н высо́кий.
    draw vysok

A: And Oleg is short: Оле́г ни́зкий.
    draw nizk

B: Высо́кий ends like ма́ленький: ий after к.
    highlight vysok color #2f6b8f part ий$ effect underline

B: About people, the kinder word is невысо́кий, not tall.
    draw nevys

A: Ivan is (@draw hud@) thin too. Худо́й is stressed on (@highlight hud color #5b8c5a part ой$ effect underline@) the end, like большо́й: Ива́н высо́кий и худо́й.

B: For a woman, the ending turns to ая: Ма́ша высо́кая.
    draw masha_v

    erase floor ivan ivan_n oleg oleg_n vysok nizk nevys hud masha_v

A: Now the face. Here is Masha:
    draw m_big eye

B: У неё голубы́е глаза́. She has blue eyes.
    draw glaza

B: У неё тёмные во́лосы. And dark hair.
    draw volosy

A: You know у неё есть from lesson 28: у неё есть кот.
    draw est_kot

A: But for looks, Russians drop the есть.
    highlight glaza volosy color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase est_kot

B: Глаза́ and во́лосы are plurals, so the colour ends in ые, as in но́вые кни́ги.
    highlight glaza volosy color #3f7f4f part ые$ effect underline

A: Голубо́й is sky blue, си́ний from lesson 71 dark blue: two colours, and blue eyes are голубы́е.
    draw swatch

    erase m_big eye glaza volosy swatch

A: And this is Masha's dad. He has a beard:
    draw papa papa_n

B: У па́пы борода́.
    draw boroda

A: Or with the with-ending you know, like (@highlight s_borodoy color #5b8c5a part ой$ effect underline@) с ма́мой: он с бородо́й.
    draw s_borodoy

    erase papa papa_n boroda s_borodoy

A: Now you find him: у него́ борода́.
    draw c_short c_masha c_beard c_line

    ask "Which of them has a beard? Tap the picture." choose ["c_short","c_masha","c_beard"] answer c_beard pool false
        right: Он с бородо́й.
        wrong: Борода́ is the beard. Who has one?

    erase c_short c_masha c_beard c_line

A: Ivan has his dad's face. He looks like him: похо́ж на.
    draw p_ivan p_ivan_n p_papa p_papa_n

B: Ива́н похо́ж на па́пу.
    draw p_line

A: After на, па́па takes the object ending: на па́пу.
    highlight p_line color #5b8c5a part у$ effect underline

A: And Masha has her mum's face.
    draw p_masha p_masha_n p_mama p_mama_n

B: Ма́ша похо́жа на ма́му.
    draw m_line

A: Like (@draw forms@) до́лжен: похо́ж for him, похо́жа (@highlight forms color #b5482e part жа$ effect underline@) for her, похо́жи (@highlight forms color #3f7f4f part жи$ effect underline@) for вы or они́.

    erase forms

A: And a brother takes а, as in ви́жу бра́та: я похо́ж на бра́та.
    draw brata

    erase p_papa p_ivan p_papa_n p_ivan_n p_line p_mama p_masha p_mama_n p_masha_n m_line brata

    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Now Masha's family party. Listen, then practise it.

    draw d_floor d_ivan d_papa parallel true

    draw talk

    highlight d_ivan color #5b8c5a duration 1.5

    draw talk

    draw talk

    highlight d_papa color #5b8c5a duration 1.5

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk d_floor d_ivan d_papa

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw q_pair q_pair2

    quiz "He looks like his dad: Он похо́ж на ___. Which form?" above ["q_pair","q_pair2"] reveal.text "похо́ж на па́пу" reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: На па́пу: after на, па́па takes the object ending.
        wrong: After на, what does па́па become, as in ви́жу па́пу?
        * па́па
        + па́пу
        * па́пой

    erase q_pair q_pair2

    draw q_ear

    ask "Who does the sister look like?" voice a options ["her mum","her dad","her brother"] correct 1 reveal.text "похо́жа на ма́му" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        gloss: I have a sister who looks a lot like Mum.
        listen: У меня́ есть сестра́, кото́рая о́чень похо́жа на ма́му.
        right: Her mum: похо́жа на ма́му.
        wrong: Listen for the last word: на ма́му.

    erase q_ear

    draw q_eye

    quiz "She has blue eyes: У неё ___ глаза́. Which word?" reveal.text "голубы́е глаза́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Голубы́е: глаза́ is plural, so the colour ends in ые.
        wrong: Глаза́ is plural. Which ending goes with plurals?
        * голубо́й
        * голуба́я
        + голубы́е

    erase question_4_stamp

    ask say_it "У неё голубы́е глаза́." gloss "She has blue eyes." voice b show cue reveal.text "У неё голубы́е глаза́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase q_eye

    draw q_m2 q_d2

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: She is tall and looks like her mum." above ["q_m2","q_d2"] answer ["она высокая и похожа на маму","высокая и похожа на маму","она высокая и похожа на свою маму"] reveal.text "похо́жа на ма́му" reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Она́ высо́кая и похо́жа на ма́му: ая and а for her, у for mum.
        wrong: Она́ высо́кая, then и, then похо́жа на and ма́ма with the object ending.

B: Она́ высо́кая и похо́жа на ма́му.
    draw q_full

    erase q_m2 q_d2 q_full

    group sum members ["b1","b2","b3"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So: высо́кий or ни́зкий; у неё, with no есть, for eyes and hair; and похо́ж на with the object ending.
    highlight sum color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase sum

B: А вы похо́жи на ма́му или на па́пу? Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["woman","girl"] icon_look picture of "woman medium skin tone"
    text end_say "А вы похо́жи на ма́му или на па́пу?" say "А вы похо́жи на ма́му или на па́пу?" say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 46
    text end_bye "Пока́!" say Пока́! say_voice b x 500 y 200 font_size 46

    erase end_masha end_say end_bye

A: Next time: the tallest and the best. Са́мый высо́кий.
    box next82 "Next: lesson 82 · са́мый высо́кий" x 500 y 430 width 680 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

